sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Customer
  participant App as Mobile app
  participant API as PostgREST
  participant DB as Money engine + Bantay guards
  participant EF as bantay-explain
  participant G as Gemini API
  C->>App: Send ₱20,000 to a new payee at 2 AM
  App->>App: Password or biometrics + authenticator code
  App->>API: transfer(..., idempotency_key)
  API->>DB: _transfer_core: lock check, daily limit, risk score
  DB-->>DB: score = new payee 30 + 3x median 30 + night 10 = 70
  DB-->>API: raise "Confirmation required" (no money moved)
  API-->>App: error mapped to a risk challenge
  App->>C: Review warning: why this looks unusual
  C->>App: Confirm it is me (fresh code)
  App->>API: confirm_risky_payment(idempotency_key)
  App->>API: transfer(..., same idempotency_key)
  API->>DB: challenge confirmed → payment proceeds once
  DB-->>App: completed transaction + security event
  App->>EF: explain(event id)
  EF->>G: masked facts only (amount band, •• 1234, time band)
  G-->>EF: short plain-text explanation
  EF-->>EF: validate facts, otherwise use the template
  EF-->>App: explanation shown in Bantay timeline
